        "text": "The probe selects candidates; task experiments decide. At the delayed site, the measured response points to a compensation, and an experiment confirms it. On the other lagging robot, the lag number misleads: the probe shows a backlog that grows. Service restores that robot, at three operator hours. A half compensation is a cheap partial fix. The record says which one the agent chose."
